(7117749, 1087553, 39429, '<td valign="top">The lighting from the tunnel(?) is wonderful.  The car image itself is rather ordinary.  I''d loved to have seen more of the window and less car.  6</td>', 'The lighting from the tunnel(?) is wonderful.  The car image itself is rather ordinary.  I''d loved to have seen more of the window and less car.  6', '2013-10-18 01:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
