(7117757, 1087284, 39429, '<td valign="top">Very well lit and beautiful door.  Making sure you were directly in front of the door instead of slightly to the side would have helped the slight tilt and distortion of the door.  Even so, very good shot.  7</td>', 'Very well lit and beautiful door.  Making sure you were directly in front of the door instead of slightly to the side would have helped the slight tilt and distortion of the door.  Even so, very good shot.  7', '2013-10-18 01:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
