(7117761, 1087551, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautiful gates and scene.  For this challenge, having the focus on the gate and letting the bench blur out would have made for a stronger entry.  5</td>', 'Beautiful gates and scene.  For this challenge, having the focus on the gate and letting the bench blur out would have made for a stronger entry.  5', '2013-10-18 01:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
