(7117777, 1087483, 39429, '<td valign="top">The shot is interesting as far as it goes, but could have had much more impact with a tighter crop, some lighting on the inside and more dof blur out of the window.  5</td>', 'The shot is interesting as far as it goes, but could have had much more impact with a tighter crop, some lighting on the inside and more dof blur out of the window.  5', '2013-10-18 01:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
