(7117786, 1087539, 39429, '<td valign="top">I love the mood and lighting here.  Obviously the image is tilted, however there is not enough tilt to feel that it was purposeful.  I''d like to see it vertical or more tilted.  Still, a very fascinating image. 7</td>', 'I love the mood and lighting here.  Obviously the image is tilted, however there is not enough tilt to feel that it was purposeful.  I''d like to see it vertical or more tilted.  Still, a very fascinating image. 7', '2013-10-18 01:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
