(7118493, 1087442, 18505, '<td valign="top">I would love to know the story behind this image.  Beautifully done.  I especially like the moody, rainy day atmosphere portrayed here.</td>', 'I would love to know the story behind this image.  Beautifully done.  I especially like the moody, rainy day atmosphere portrayed here.', '2013-10-19 15:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118495, 1087260, 18505, '<td valign="top">I like how there is just enough to the side of the door to make one wonder about the rest of it...  Is it still attached and functional?  Is it part of a second-hand offering?  If this door could talk, what stories could it tell?  If more editing were allowed in this challenge, I would have liked to have been shown more of the grain and character of the door, but you have shown a very nice image as is.  Good work!!</td>', 'I like how there is just enough to the side of the door to make one wonder about the rest of it...  Is it still attached and functional?  Is it part of a second-hand offering?  If this door could talk, what stories could it tell?  If more editing were allowed in this challenge, I would have liked to have been shown more of the grain and character of the door, but you have shown a very nice image as is.  Good work!!', '2013-10-19 15:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118496, 1087557, 18505, '<td valign="top">Besides showing us a beautiful, intriguing door, you have managed to include the wonderful grain and textures of the wood.  I think this is one of the top images in this challenge.</td>', 'Besides showing us a beautiful, intriguing door, you have managed to include the wonderful grain and textures of the wood.  I think this is one of the top images in this challenge.', '2013-10-19 15:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118497, 1087512, 18505, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh out loud...  Thank you!</td>', 'This one made me laugh out loud...  Thank you!', '2013-10-19 15:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118546, 1087017, 18505, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote on this one, but I love the warm colors and the beautiful tones you have achieved in this image.  Good work!  The numbers on the shuttered windows provide just the right touch!</td>', 'I can''t vote on this one, but I love the warm colors and the beautiful tones you have achieved in this image.  Good work!  The numbers on the shuttered windows provide just the right touch!', '2013-10-19 16:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118547, 1087544, 18505, '<td valign="top">The colors in this image are wonderful.  Great composition, texture and tones... your Grandpa would be very proud to have his toolbox transformed into art!  Can''t vote on this one, but it would have been a 10 if I could have voted.</td>', 'The colors in this image are wonderful.  Great composition, texture and tones... your Grandpa would be very proud to have his toolbox transformed into art!  Can''t vote on this one, but it would have been a 10 if I could have voted.', '2013-10-19 16:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118553, 1087402, 18505, '<td valign="top">Voted before... coming around to comment...<br/> <br/>This is so timely and so well done.   I love the contrast between the rustic oranges and woodgrain of the object being guarded by the tiny padlock and the much more modernistic bokah area.  The individual who seems to be in a suit adds to the mystery and irony of the image.  I''m looking forward to seeing the story behind the image when the challenge is over.</td>', 'Voted before... coming around to comment... This is so timely and so well done.   I love the contrast between the rustic oranges and woodgrain of the object being guarded by the tiny padlock and the much more modernistic bokah area.  The individual who seems to be in a suit adds to the mystery and irony of the image.  I''m looking forward to seeing the story behind the image when the challenge is over.', '2013-10-19 16:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118558, 1087092, 18505, '<td valign="top">Voted before... coming around to comment...<br/> <br/>Beautiful shapes and tones in this image.  It is nice to see what can be accomplished with desaturation in a minimal editing challenge.  I think the interesting black patterns in the glass and the impact of the person in the image would have been lessened in a colorful image.  Good job!</td>', 'Voted before... coming around to comment... Beautiful shapes and tones in this image.  It is nice to see what can be accomplished with desaturation in a minimal editing challenge.  I think the interesting black patterns in the glass and the impact of the person in the image would have been lessened in a colorful image.  Good job!', '2013-10-19 16:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7118563, 1087073, 18505, '<td valign="top">Voted before... coming around to comment...<br/> <br/>I find this to be a very interesting (and somewhat disturbing) image.  I''m really curious as to how this was accomplished.  I can find many levels in meaning in this image.</td>', 'Voted before... coming around to comment... I find this to be a very interesting (and somewhat disturbing) image.  I''m really curious as to how this was accomplished.  I can find many levels in meaning in this image.', '2013-10-19 17:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
