(7121162, 1087556, 170018, '<td valign="top">Only my humble opinion, but I would love this in b&amp;w with strong vignette. Nice lines formed by the doors.</td>', 'Only my humble opinion, but I would love this in b&w with strong vignette. Nice lines formed by the doors.', '2013-10-24 01:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7121165, 1087284, 170018, '<td valign="top">Wow, terrific lighting! <br/>You leveled the shot nicely by footstep, by door frame is not symmetrical. It''s funny, because no matter how many times I''ve tried to level my shots by one side, the other is always skewed by perspective. :-) Still a great shot! 8</td>', 'Wow, terrific lighting! You leveled the shot nicely by footstep, by door frame is not symmetrical. It''s funny, because no matter how many times I''ve tried to level my shots by one side, the other is always skewed by perspective. :-) Still a great shot! 8', '2013-10-24 01:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7121166, 1087402, 170018, '<td valign="top">Can go on magazine cover...</td>', 'Can go on magazine cover...', '2013-10-24 01:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
